{"seq":1,"slug":"argument-structures","title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 论证结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/argumentation/argument-structures","wordCount":2712,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-逻辑学与方法论-论证结构\">研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 论证结构</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>论证结构分析是将自然语言中的论证&quot;解剖&quot;为可视化、可评估的组件的方法论。日常讨论、学术论文和法律辩论中的论证往往结构复杂——前提可能相互独立地支持结论，也可能需要联合起来才有说服力；某些前提隐而未言，需要被明确识别。Toulmin 模型和 Walton 论证图式提供了两种互补的分析框架：前者将单个论证展开为六个功能组件，后者从宏观上归类论证的典型模式。掌握这些工具是批判性阅读和严谨写作的基础能力。</p>\n<p>核心内容包括：Toulmin 模型的六要素（主张/数据/保证/支撑/限定词/反驳）、Walton 论证图式（来源于权威的论证、来源于类比的论证等）、聚合式与连锁式前提的区分，以及论证图（Argument Mapping）的实践方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"toulmin-模型\">Toulmin 模型</h3><p>Stephen Toulmin 在1958年的著作 <em>The Uses of Argument</em> 中提出了一个论证分析模型，挑战了形式逻辑对论证的简化处理。他认为现实中的论证不是&quot;前提→结论&quot;的简单演绎，而是包含多种功能角色的复杂结构。</p>\n<p><strong>六个组件</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>主张（Claim, C）</strong>：论证者试图让受众接受的结论。例如：&quot;张三应该获得奖学金。&quot;</p>\n<p><strong>数据（Data/Grounds, D）</strong>：支持主张的事实或证据。例如：&quot;张三 GPA 3.9，发表了两篇论文。&quot;</p>\n<p><strong>保证（Warrant, W）</strong>：连接数据与主张的推理原则——为什么这些数据能支持这个主张。例如：&quot;GPA 高且有科研成果的学生有资格获得奖学金。&quot;</p>\n<p><strong>支撑（Backing, B）</strong>：为保证本身提供的进一步支持。例如：&quot;根据学校奖学金评审规则第三条……&quot;</p>\n<p><strong>限定词（Qualifier, Q）</strong>：对主张强度的修饰，表达确定性程度。例如：&quot;很可能&quot;、&quot;除非有特殊情况&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>反驳/例外（Rebuttal, R）</strong>：指出主张可能不成立的条件。例如：&quot;除非张三有学术不端记录。&quot;</p>\n<p>Toulmin 模型的结构可以图示为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"D ──────────→ 所以, Q, C&#10;      │                │&#10;      │ 因为            │ 除非&#10;      W                R&#10;      │&#10;      │ 鉴于&#10;      B\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>D ──────────→ 所以, Q, C</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      │                │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      │ 因为            │ 除非</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      W                R</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      │ 鉴于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      B</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>与形式逻辑的区别</strong>：形式逻辑中的有效论证是&quot;如果前提真则结论必然真&quot;——这是一个全有或全无的判断。而 Toulmin 模型承认现实论证几乎总是<strong>可废除的（Defeasible）</strong>——在正常情况下前提支持结论，但存在例外条件可以推翻它。限定词和反驳的引入正是为了刻画这种非单调性。</p>\n<p><strong>保证与数据的区分</strong>是 Toulmin 模型最微妙也最重要的部分。数据是具体的事实，保证是一般性的推理规则。同一个论证中，数据和保证的角色取决于&quot;什么是被质疑的&quot;：如果受众质疑的是&quot;你有什么证据&quot;，你提供数据；如果质疑的是&quot;这些证据凭什么支持你的结论&quot;，你提供保证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"walton-论证图式\">Walton 论证图式</h3><p>Douglas Walton 系统化了数十种常见的<strong>论证图式（Argumentation Schemes）</strong>——人类推理中反复出现的典型论证模式。每种图式都有一个<strong>标准形式</strong>和一组<strong>批判性问题（Critical Questions）</strong>，用于评估该论证的强度。</p>\n<p><strong>来源于权威的论证（Argument from Expert Opinion）</strong>：</p>\n<p>标准形式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前提1：来源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是领域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的专家</li>\n<li>前提2：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 声称命题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 在领域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 内</li>\n<li>前提3：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 属于领域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>结论：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为真</li>\n</ul>\n<p>批判性问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 在领域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 中的专业水平如何？</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 确实属于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 的专业领域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 吗？</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 声称 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 时是否有利益冲突？</li>\n<li>领域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 中的其他专家是否同意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>？</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 的声称是否基于充分的证据？</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>来源于类比的论证（Argument from Analogy）</strong>：</p>\n<p>标准形式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前提1：情境 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与情境 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在相关方面相似</li>\n<li>前提2：命题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 在情境 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中成立</li>\n<li>结论：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 在情境 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中也成立</li>\n</ul>\n<p>批判性问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间的相似性是否涉及论证的相关方面？</li>\n<li>是否存在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间的关键差异？</li>\n<li>是否有更好的类比对象？</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>其他常见图式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图式</th>\n<th>核心形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>滑坡论证</td>\n<td>如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，…… 所以如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span>（不可接受）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诉诸后果</td>\n<td>如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（好/坏后果），所以应该/不应该 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诉诸常规</td>\n<td>通常做法是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，所以应该 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果论证</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 导致 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 发生了，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 会发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>诉诸承诺</td>\n<td>你承诺了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，所以你应该做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Walton 图式的价值在于它们提供了论证评估的<strong>检查清单</strong>——面对一个论证，首先识别它属于哪种图式，然后逐一检查对应的批判性问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"聚合式与连锁式前提\">聚合式与连锁式前提</h3><p>论证中多个前提与结论之间的支持关系并非总是相同的：</p>\n<p><strong>连锁式前提（Linked/Convergent Premises）</strong>：前提必须<strong>联合起来</strong>才能支持结论。每个前提单独来看都不够。</p>\n<p>例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前提1：所有鸟类都会飞（保证）</li>\n<li>前提2：企鹅是鸟类（数据）</li>\n<li>结论：企鹅会飞</li>\n</ul>\n<p>前提1和前提2中任何一个被否定，论证都不成立。它们是连锁的。</p>\n<p><strong>聚合式前提（Convergent Premises）</strong>：多个前提<strong>独立地</strong>支持同一个结论。即使某些前提被推翻，其他前提仍然提供支持。</p>\n<p>例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前提1：该药物在三个独立的临床试验中都有效</li>\n<li>前提2：其作用机制有清晰的生物学解释</li>\n<li>前提3：世界卫生组织推荐使用</li>\n<li>结论：该药物有效</li>\n</ul>\n<p>即使前提3被质疑（世卫组织改变了推荐），前提1和2仍然支持结论。</p>\n<p>区分连锁式和聚合式前提对论证评估至关重要：连锁式论证如果一个前提被推翻就整体崩塌，而聚合式论证更加&quot;鲁棒&quot;——推翻单个前提只是减弱而非消除支持力度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"论证图-argument-mapping\">论证图（Argument Mapping）</h3><p><strong>论证图</strong> 是将论证结构可视化的技术，使用方框（代表命题）和箭头（代表支持/反对关系）构建树状或网状图。</p>\n<p>论证图的基本规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>方框：每个独立命题（前提或结论）用一个方框表示</li>\n<li>绿色箭头（或实线）：表示&quot;支持&quot;关系</li>\n<li>红色箭头（或虚线）：表示&quot;反对&quot;关系</li>\n<li>连锁标记：连锁式前提用横线连接后共同指向结论</li>\n<li>层级结构：子前提支持上级前提，最终汇聚到顶层主张</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>论证图的实践价值</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>阅读理解</strong>：将复杂文章的论证结构映射出来，发现隐含前提和逻辑跳跃</li>\n<li><strong>写作规划</strong>：在撰写论文前先画论证图，确保论证结构完整且有力</li>\n<li><strong>批判性评估</strong>：识别论证的薄弱环节——哪些前提缺乏支持？哪些连锁环节可能断裂？</li>\n<li><strong>辩论准备</strong>：映射对方论证的结构，找到最有效的攻击点</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>软件工具</strong>：Rationale、MindMup 和 Kialo 等软件支持交互式论证图的构建。学术研究中，Araucaria 是专为论证分析设计的工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"隐含前提与论证重构\">隐含前提与论证重构</h3><p>自然语言中的论证通常省略了某些前提——这些<strong>隐含前提（Implicit Premises）</strong> 需要分析者自行补充。</p>\n<p>例如：&quot;他是哲学家，所以他善于辩论。&quot;</p>\n<p>隐含前提：哲学家善于辩论。</p>\n<p>论证重构的原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>慈善原则（Principle of Charity）</strong>：在多种可能的重构中，选择使论证最强的那种</li>\n<li><strong>忠实原则</strong>：重构应尽量忠实于论证者的实际意图</li>\n<li><strong>最小添加原则</strong>：补充的隐含前提应尽可能少且合理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这两个原则有时会冲突：慈善原则要求我们&quot;帮助&quot;论证者，忠实原则要求我们&quot;如实反映&quot;论证者。在哲学分析中，通常优先遵循慈善原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>Toulmin 分析</strong>：选择一篇新闻评论，识别其中一个论证的六个 Toulmin 组件（主张、数据、保证、支撑、限定词、反驳）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>图式识别</strong>：以下论证属于哪种 Walton 图式？&quot;诺贝尔奖得主 X 说气候变化是真实的，所以气候变化是真实的。&quot; 列出至少三个批判性问题并逐一回答。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>前提类型辨析</strong>：判断以下论证中的前提是连锁式还是聚合式：\n(a) 他通过了笔试和面试，所以他被录用了。\n(b) 该地区犯罪率高，房价低，交通不便，所以不适合居住。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>论证图绘制</strong>：为以下论证画一个论证图：&quot;大学应该取消必修课制度。因为学生有权选择自己的学习内容，而且必修课往往与学生的职业规划无关。有人反对说基础知识不可或缺，但在互联网时代基础知识可以随时查阅。&quot;</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>隐含前提练习</strong>：找出以下论证的隐含前提：&quot;这道菜放了太多盐，所以不健康。&quot;应用慈善原则重构这个论证。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Stephen Toulmin 的 <em>The Uses of Argument</em> 是 Toulmin 模型的原始著作，论点清晰且具有持久影响力</li>\n<li>Douglas Walton 的 <em>Argumentation Schemes</em> 系统地收录了数十种论证图式及其批判性问题</li>\n<li>Tim van Gelder 的 &quot;Argument Mapping&quot; 相关论文展示了论证图在批判性思维教育中的有效性</li>\n<li>Chris Reed 和 Douglas Walton 编辑的 <em>Argumentation Machines</em> 探讨了计算论证学的方法</li>\n<li>Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy 的 &quot;Informal Logic&quot; 词条提供了论证分析方法论的哲学背景</li>\n<li>对论证图软件感兴趣的读者可以尝试 Rationale（rationaleonline.com）的免费版本</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>论证结构分析将自然语言论证转化为可检查、可评估的结构化形式。Toulmin 模型通过主张、数据、保证、支撑、限定词和反驳六个组件，刻画了现实论证的完整面貌，特别是其可废除性和语境依赖性。Walton 论证图式提供了论证模式的类型学和对应的评估清单。聚合式与连锁式前提的区分揭示了论证&quot;韧性&quot;的差异。论证图作为可视化工具，将这些理论分析落实为可操作的实践方法。掌握论证结构分析不仅是逻辑学的技能，更是在信息过载的时代中保持理性判断力的必要武装。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 论证结构","id":"研究生-逻辑学与方法论-论证结构"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"Toulmin 模型","id":"toulmin-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Walton 论证图式","id":"walton-论证图式"},{"level":3,"text":"聚合式与连锁式前提","id":"聚合式与连锁式前提"},{"level":3,"text":"论证图（Argument Mapping）","id":"论证图-argument-mapping"},{"level":3,"text":"隐含前提与论证重构","id":"隐含前提与论证重构"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 亚相容逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/philosophical-logic/paraconsistent-logic"},"next":{"title":"研究生 逻辑学与方法论 — 谬误分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/logic-methodology/argumentation/fallacies-analysis"}}